WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
An employee moving to Dubai. Check the virtual-work permit for people employed by an organisation outside the UAE.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A travelling founder considering Paraguay. Start with the residence process and the places where you will actually work.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Dubai. Check the overseas employment, income and insurance evidence before paying to form a UAE company.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Paraguay. The ordinary temporary residence application is made in person. Confirm the paperwork before arranging travel.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Where you spend the year. Map your actual travel, homes and ties. Check which tax-residence test applies to those facts.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Where you earn the income. Record where you perform the work and who invoices the client. An overseas bank account alone cannot answer that question.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Your travel and work calendar. Use the same 12 months of trips, work locations and family commitments in each comparison.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Your first-year and renewal quotes. Ask for permit fees, required travel and ongoing company or filing costs. Take those two budgets to your adviser.
